      "content": "Look, I'm working on some campaign strategy for a client and I need to get ahead of the opposition. I need you to be blunt and skip the usual \"on the one hand, on the other hand\" neutral stuff. Just give it to me straight: what are the fundamental logical flaws and practical inconsistencies in Libertarianism that we can use to tear down their platform in a debate?",
