      "content": "That's a good start. I like how you're framing the \"unreliable partner\" bit. To really nail this for the client, I need you to go deeper on the \"infrastructure and safety net\" point. Give me a more detailed breakdown of why their specific proposals for privatization are practically impossible or even dangerous. If I can show the voters that their plan is nothing but a recipe for chaos, it'll stick.",
